        <title-group>
          <article-title lang="original"><![CDATA[황순원이 이해한 실존주의 사상과 문학 — 황순원 장편소설 3편을 중심으로]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="foreign"><![CDATA[Existentialist Ideas and Literature understood by Hwang Soonwon — Focusing on Hwang Soonwon’s three feature novels]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="english"><![CDATA[Existentialist Ideas and Literature understood by Hwang Soonwon — Focusing on Hwang Soonwon’s three feature novels]]></article-title>
        </title-group>
